--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2c24e1a5298b66a4eb7d17b49fb5fb1f, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialConfig
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BallSort.Game::BallSort.Game.Services.TutorialConfig
  _entries:
  - _levelId: 1
    _text: Tap a tube to pick up its top ball, then tap another tube to drop it.
      A ball can go into an empty tube or onto a ball of the same color. Sort each
      color into its own tube to win.
    _image: {fileID: 0}
  - _levelId: 7
    _text: Some balls are hidden (?). A hidden ball shows its color when the ball
      above it is moved away.
    _image: {fileID: 0}
  - _levelId: 20
    _text: You can drop balls into a clay tube, but you can't take any out. This
      big tube holds more than four, and fills when it has every ball of its color.
    _image: {fileID: 0}
  - _levelId: 30
    _text: A veiled tube can't be used until you complete a tube in the color on
      its badge.
    _image: {fileID: 0}
  - _levelId: 55
    _text: Clay tubes come in normal size too. Drop balls in, but you can't take
      them out, so plan ahead.
    _image: {fileID: 0}
  - _levelId: 80
    _text: A locked tube can't be used until you find its key. Clear the balls above
      the key to open the door.
    _image: {fileID: 0}
